  "id": "emotional-unconscious",
  "term": "emotional unconscious",
  "definition": "Emotional unconscious refers to emotional processing that occurs outside conscious awareness and can influence how people organize and connect information during learning. In this source, it is described as part of the unnoticed mental activity involved in integrating verbal and visual material.",
